              &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                                  =
  2. To connect a wireless printer, download the latest=0A                 =
                                   driver and software package for your pri=
nter model from=0A                                                    the o=
fficial website and follow these steps:=0A                                 =
               &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A=0A                                          =
      &lt;p&gt;a) Select the Start button, then select Settings &gt;=0A             =
                                       Devices &gt; Printers &amp; scanners &gt; Add =
a printer or=0A                                                    scanner.=
&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;b) Wait for it to=
 find nearby printers, then choose the=0A                                  =
                  one you want to use, and select Add device. If you want=
=0A                                                    to remove the printe=
r later, just highlight it and=0A                                          =
          select Remove.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A                             =
                   &lt;h3 class=3D&quot;my-4&quot;&gt;Setup a New Printer (Mac)&lt;/h3&gt;=0A=0A =
                                               &lt;strong&gt;=0A                 =
