                                  &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                          =
                      &lt;p&gt;Use the instructions that came with your printer t=
o=0A                                                    unpack the printer,=
 install ink or toner, and add paper.=0A                                   =
                 Turn on the printer and make sure it=E2=80=99s not display=
ing=0A                                                    any errors.&lt;/p&gt;=
=0A=0A                                                &lt;strong&gt;=0A          =
                                          2. Connect your printer: Follow t=
he instructions that=0A                                                    =
came with the printer to connect it to the network.=0A                     =
                           &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                 =
               &lt;p&gt;=0A                                                    If=
 you have a Wi-Fi printer, you might need to connect=0A                    =
                                the printer to your Mac with a USB cable to=
 set up Wi-Fi=0A                                                    printin=
g. After connecting the printer to your Mac,=0A                            =
                        install the Mac software that came with the printer=
 and=0A                                                    use the printer=
=E2=80=99s setup assistant to connect the printer=0A                       =
                             to your Wi-Fi network. After setting up, you c=
an=0A                                                    disconnect the cab=
le from your printer and Mac and the=0A                                    =
                printer should remain connected to the Wi-Fi network.=0A   =
                                             &lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                    =
                            &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                    =
                3. Add the printer to your list of available printers:=0A  =
                                              &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A              =
                                  &lt;p&gt;=0A                                   =
                 Choose Apple menu &gt; System Settings, then click Printers=
=0A                                                    &amp; Scanners in the si=
debar. (You may need to scroll=0A                                          =
          down.)&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;=
strong&gt;=0A                                                    4. When your =
printer appears in the list, select your=0A                                =
                    printer, then click Add.=0A                            =
                    &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A=0A                                     =
           &lt;p&gt; It may take a minute or two for your printer to appear.=0A  =
                                                  If you see a message prom=
pting you to download new=0A                                               =
